"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",\"111\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",\"112\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n77:[\"$\",\"p\",\"113\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",\"114\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n79:[\"$\",\"p\",\"115\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"116\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"117\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"118\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"119\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"120\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"121\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n80:[\"$\",\"p\",\"122\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/northern-mockingbird/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Northern Mockingbird\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"111\",{\"href\":\"/animal/mandarin-dragonet/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Mandarin Dragonet\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"138\",{\"href\":\"/animal/french-angelfish/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"French Angelfish\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"164\",{\"href\":\"/animal/barn-swallow/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Barn Swallow\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"190\",{\"href\":\"/animal/boykin-spaniel/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Boykin Spaniel\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n81:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do I choose between multiple name options?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Try each name for a full day. Say it often, use it during play, and see which one feels most natural. The name that makes you smile every time is the winner. Trust your instincts!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can my pet have a middle name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! Many pet owners give middle names — especially useful for when your pet is being mischievous. 'Luna Bean Smith, stop that!' has a certain ring to it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should pet names match pet insurance registration?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Use the same name consistently across vet records, microchips, and insurance. In an emergency, a consistent name helps veterinary staff quickly identify and treat your pet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What if I change my pet's name after adoption?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Adult pets can learn new names with patience. Use lots of treats and positive reinforcement. Most pets adjust within a few weeks. Consistency is key.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n82:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"scarlet-ibis\",{\"href\":\"/animal/scarlet-ibis/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦤\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Scarlet Ibis\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"urial\",{\"href\":\"/animal/urial/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐑\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm fon